Package: nereusd
Version: @VERSION@
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: JJ Boyd <kg4vcf@gmail.com>
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: NereusSDR headless station daemon
 Runs a radio station as a systemd service when configured by the operator.
 The package leaves the service disabled and does not start it on install.
